          "reasons": [
           {
            "@type": "meaningComprehension",
            "comprehends": [
             "copies/nn203bm7432#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded medium on the figures of the date: one figure is arguable. Pencil, four figures on the lower (upright) panel, nothing else in the crop. Each figure is plain: the open German 4, then 6, then two 2s set close together, spaced 4 | 6 | 22, which reads 4.6.22 with the points dropped. The reservation is the same as on sz207mm8382: a run of figures like this could in principle be a roll number 4622, and nothing else in the crop decides it, though the three groups favour a date."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       },
       "medium": "pencil"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
